      "content": "but what \"way\" are you talking about? like, how can i just stop pretending? the world doesn't just let you be who you are. as soon as i stop the act, everything falls apart. it feels like the only way to actually be at peace is to just... not be part of it anymore. it feels like a losing battle.",
