      "content": "it's not just about taking a break though. it's more like... the whole thing is just broken. the more i fight, the more i lose myself. it feels like i'm just running on a treadmill that's going way too fast and i'm about to fall off. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the noise and finally be still is to just quit. for real. does that even make sense? that sometimes quitting is the only way to win?",
